Package: com.mell.fakepass13
Name: FakePass13
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Fake passcode lock screen for iOS 13. Draws its own lock screen with a keypad on top of the system lock screen, for devices where the real passcode / Face ID does not work (broken SEP after a downgrade).
Maintainer: mell
Author: mell
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 13.0), firmware (<< 14.0)
Tag: purpose::extension
